<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-FILDERSTADT WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FILDERSTADT WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>FILDERSTADT, Germany 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the</p>
<p>$450,000 Filderstadt women's tennis tournament on Thursday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>5-Anke Huber (Germany) beat Brenda Schultz-McCarthy</p>
<p>(Netherlands) 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>3-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat Barbara Rittner (Germany) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>4-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat Natalia Medvedeva (Ukraine) 6-1</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>6-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat Dominique van Roost (Belgium) 6-2 6-1</p>
</text>
